      "content": "REST API for programmatic distribution of digital rewards including gift cards, merchandise, experiences, charity donations, lounge access, airmiles, and mobile top-ups across 150+ countries. Supports full reward lifecycle management including catalog browsing, order placement, order tracking, and payment reconciliation. Also provides APIs for reward points distribution, reward links generation, and storefront SSO integration.",
